{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121336","id":4047183391,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7xOx4f","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121336","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121336.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121336.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121336","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121336/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121336/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121336/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9279e4c63942ed893ae702c49648f657edc0ab84","number":121336,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix BoneTwistDisperser stale joint update crash","user":{"login":"rathodkunj2005","id":86590228,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTkwMjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86590228?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005","html_url":"https://github.com/rathodkunj2005","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes godotengine/godot#121264.\n\n`BoneTwistDisperser3D::_make_joints_dirty()` defers `_update_joints(index)`. If settings are cleared before the deferred call runs, the saved index can be stale and `_update_joints()` dereferences `settings[p_index]` without re-validating it.\n\nThis adds the same index guard used by the other setting/joint helpers before `_update_joints()` reads the settings array.\n\nVerification:\n\nThe `repro/Node.tscn` command below uses the MRP from godotengine/godot#121264. The final run is the post-fix behavior: it reports the guarded out-of-bounds error and exits cleanly instead of crashing.\n\n```text\n$ python3 -m SCons platform=macos target=template_debug dev_build=yes tools=no vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no -j4\nscons: done building targets.\nINFO: Time elapsed: 00:05:19.87\n\n$ python3 -m SCons platform=macos target=template_debug dev_build=yes tools=no vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no disable_path_overrides=no -j4\nscons: done building targets.\nINFO: Time elapsed: 00:07:06.91\n\n$ ./bin/godot.macos.template_debug.dev.arm64 --headless --path repro Node.tscn\nGodot Engine v4.8.dev.custom_build.4efc6b49e (2026-07-13 18:51:09 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\nERROR: Index p_index = 60 is out of bounds ((int)settings.size() = 0).\n   at: _update_joints (scene/3d/bone_twist_disperser_3d.cpp:604)\n[exit code 0]\n```\n\nAI assistance disclosure: AI tools were used to help inspect the issue and draft this small change/PR text. I reviewed the resulting code and ran the verification locally.\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327